[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Solanum (Pomodoro background service)
Comment=Starts Solanum as a background GApplication service so the pomodoro timer survives and notifications fire even when its window is closed. Toggle the window with SUPER+SHIFT+P or `solanum`.
Exec=solanum --gapplication-service
Icon=org.gnome.Solanum
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
